  "seoDescription": "We are at an ideological turn that is dismantling every risk dependency. An uncommon moment has arrived. The blocks that have taken us this far are incongruent with the modalities of work necessary to take us further. Old drivers are fading. How do we plan a new beginning? Things have fallen apart and the core"
