  "seoDescription": "Uberisation has oozed into cloistered University campuses. Many universities have faculty who deliver supervisions but who have precarious contracts. This is bad for students, the faculty and any prospect of departments having a rigorous research agenda. In the finance industry, the pandemic shuttering of businesses in 2020, and the meteoric rise of remote work, permitted"
