  "seoDescription": "At the close of 2022, there remains quite a lot of industrial and manufacturing assets that just won’t be relevant for much longer. Much of it will become stranded and subject to demographic decline. But not all of it will have to be replaced. In the fractured world that is emerging, the longer and more"
