  "seoDescription": "There is a widespread view that the hamlets and cities that hug the Mediterranean basin are the ultimate in climate, comfort, and culture. Year-round, millions flock to enjoy the mild climate, gastronomy, art and architecture, and the romantic charm of the old world. It is a world that millions have visited through Walcott’s Omeros and"
