  "seoDescription": "There is no political sovereignty outside of technological independence. So how do states concretely address this ambition in practice? Some countries have elected to focus on (1) building the industrial, research, and innovation ecosystem, (2) securing digital and telecommunication businesses and infrastructure, and (3) regulating the digital sector and data protection. One blind spot remains"
