  "seoDescription": "The struggles to contain COVID-19 have had a weighty impact on industries and workers worldwide. The pandemic experience has accelerated companies’ digital transformation. Building on Rawls’ development ethics in his “Theory of Justice”, Sen proposes a capabilities approach to development that hinges on social arrangements that are valued primarily around the extent to which citizens"
