  "seoDescription": "There is no “New Normal”. Only a prolonged “Never Normal” — Volatility, Uncertainty, Complexity and Ambiguity (VUCA). Countless networked parts. Data overload. Unstable challenges of unknown duration. Unknown unknowns. Unclear relationships. Cause and effect severed. Every response requiring hypothesising and experimentation, investing in information, testing, reshuffling, and building in slack. Facing multilayers of possible futures,"
