  "seoTitle": "Yellow Is Forbidden | Fazal Ali",
  "seoDescription": "Yuppie is fashion’s next big thing. Paradoxically, the new corporate costume of Generation-Z is the power-suit silhouette of the 80s. The look of interns hoping to navigate capitalist structures in our COVID-19 remote-work-world revolves around the revival of the suited Wall Street look with a touch of knowing self-reference embellished with rudiments of playful style."
