  "seoTitle": "The Untruthful and the Omitted | Fazal Ali",
  "seoDescription": "Are voters insensitive to lies? Rumi writes that the tongue is a guttering where words flow. But if the roof is not clean, then the words get thick and muddy. But what is more chilling is the fake eloquence of those who have erected elaborate gutters that drain water from other roofs. So why do"
