  "seoDescription": "The virus is uncovering the extent of inequalities within many countries, including OECD countries. In the process, it is exposing the deficiencies of the social contract and the ways in which slum dwellers are systematically at-risk. COVID-19 lays open the social and economic fault lines in our urban spaces among the 1.2 billion urban poor"
