  "seoDescription": "Burning Glass Technologies in Boston filters data from online job advertisements to classify emerging combinations of skill that hybrid jobs are competing for globally. In the U.S., 49% of the postings in the quartile of occupations with the highest salaries are for jobs that require coding. Coding is now requisite far beyond the technology sector."
