  "seoTitle": "Converging at the GATE after divergence at 11+ | Fazal Ali",
  "seoDescription": "BMW spent €400 million building a new factory near Leipzig. The 110-metre ‘i’ assembly line has fourteen work stations because of a new parallel assembly process and the fewer parts used in the new carbon-fibre-reinforced polymer (CFRP) structure of their vehicles. There is no paint shop. A traditional press shop is absent because the passenger"
