  "seoDescription": "Those who think for themselves know that that the cobwebs they spin are fragile and incomplete; but those content to be disciples and become entangled in the gossamer of others, forget that brittleness and imagine that they have landed on stable ground. Franchised ideas, which were originally intended to be only skeletal in creating a"
